# SQL design sync

Created/changed a `*.schema.ts`? Run the **schema-change** chain in its order — the
`src/domains/**/*.schema.ts` row of [`agent-os/docs/skill-triggers.md`](../docs/skill-triggers.md), generated from `agent-os/skills/chains.json` (this rule
keeps no copy of the steps). This rule's own step is
**[be-sql-design-guard](../skills/be-sql-design-guard/SKILL.md)**: indexes, partitioning,
constraint names, column types, soft-delete.
